      "short": "Probabilities must be between 0 and 1 inclusive: 1.3 exceeds 1, and −0.2 and −0.1 are negative.",
      "worked": "Each probability must satisfy $0\\leq P(E)\\leq1$. The value $1.3$ exceeds 1, and $-0.2$ and $-0.1$ are negative. Although the values sum to 1, the individual probabilities are invalid.",
